## Common mistakes to watch for

- Spaces around `=` in a variable assignment (`name = "x"` breaks; use `name="x"`)
- Missing spaces inside `[ ]` (`["$num" -gt 0]` breaks; use `[ "$num" -gt 0 ]`)
- Forgetting `then` or `fi`
- Forgetting `chmod +x`, which causes "Permission denied"
- Using `>` instead of `-gt` for number comparisons inside `[ ]`

